<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Every Zhex diagnostic code with its meaning and fix — the stable catalog behind the checker's messages.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f3ec">
  <title>Errors — Zhex</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="Zhex home"><img class="brand-logo" src="logo.svg" width="168" height="50" alt=""></a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="examples.html">Examples</a>
      <a href="docs.html">Docs</a>
      <a href="errors.html" aria-current="page">Errors</a>
      <a href="./#start">Get started</a>
      <a href="roadmap.html">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/desireco/zhex">GitHub ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <section class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Diagnostics</p>
      <h1>Every error,<br>by name.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Each diagnostic carries a stable code. The first line is always <code>file:line:column: message</code>; the source excerpt, caret, and <code>hint:</code> are additive detail.</p>
      <p class="aside">Machine readers: <code>zhex run file.zhex --report=json</code> emits <code>{code, severity, file, line, column, message, hint}</code>. The contract lives in the repository at <a href="https://github.com/desireco/zhex/blob/main/docs/diagnostics-plan.md">docs/diagnostics-plan.md</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">The catalog</p><h2 id="catalog-title">What it means, how to fix it.</h2></div>
        <p class="intro">Codes are stable: never renamed, never reused. The catalog is generated from the interpreter's own definitions, so it cannot drift from the compiler.</p>
      </div>

      {{range .Catalog}}
      <div class="docs-feature" id="{{.Code}}">
        <h3><code>{{.Code}}</code></h3>
        <p>{{.Text | codeChips}}</p>
      </div>
      {{end}}
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="Zhex home"><img class="brand-logo" src="logo.svg" width="138" height="41" alt=""></a>
    <p>Small words. Big ideas.</p>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="design/design-system.html">Design system</a>
      <a href="design/archive/">Design archive</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/users/desireco/projects/8">Project board ↗</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/desireco/zhex/blob/main/docs/initial-language.md">Language reference ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
